{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bcd12e4e825d8f161c64960ceacb2522bea3785ff9fa7d97c8ace8c72ff61317", "ja": "（雪歩が出演するロケは快調に進み、\n予定より早く終了することができた）", "zh": "（雪步参加的外景节目拍得很顺利，\n比预期来得更早结束。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ed63e3402ea050b859a6cd82072bcf4a9384375c2e0d375c3155b196d8ce4f35", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまでしたぁ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n你工作辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4d1677e3d16ea44cab6e07bca544ded78b59d65bf860caebbc20f988a87fa153", "ja": "お疲れさま、雪歩。今日は絶好調だったな。\n何かいいことでもあったのか？", "zh": "雪步，辛苦你了，你今天状态很好呢。\n发生了什么好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2b056410750e8c708d0083f7d2ded8deca5c88f88b4a76ea1f08b61ea79c022a", "ja": "はい、実は今朝見たTVの占いで、\n私の……やぎ座でA型の運勢が、1位だったんです。", "zh": "对，其实我今天早上看见电视上的占卜节目说，\n我……摩羯座A型的运势是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d95596d68b590a06b942b670d190dc074fe2a0d416cab56ed14207bd691311f5", "ja": "占いによると、今日は何をしても上手くいく\n超ハッピーデーらしいんですよ。", "zh": "根据占卜结果，今天好像是我的超幸运日，\n不管做什么都会很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bf4a5b9cfa5c51d6778259908c8d96d55a7c726c812da21477cc4f1fa547f35d", "ja": "この番組の占いはよく当たるって、\nあずささんに聞いてたから、すごく嬉しくて……。", "zh": "阿梓姊之前说过，这个节目的占卜相当准，\n所以我非常高兴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a525a9506822cc963db176a975b7290a1f6b29cb8ee194655e4c3e99c4bc0259", "ja": "そのおかげかもですけど、朝に淹れたお茶に\n茶柱が5本も立ってたんですぅ！", "zh": "也许是因为这样，我在早上泡茶时，\n茶里面有五根茶梗立起来了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a9f6389c592cd07576fcfebe47f8d158c5067a3e9cff2987d8d0979a63b20e91", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。\nそれで調子がよかったのか。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样。\n所以你的状态才这么好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8c0fac0fe824603729676849bf514635541d1ea0591263069d1c2b291bcc8e90", "ja": "はいっ。しかもラッキーアイテムが白いお花で、\n見つけると運気がさらにアップするみたいなんです。", "zh": "是的，而且我的幸运物是白花，\n好像找到白花就能让运势变得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a777ce0082909de18feb869d7f0ee1dd5398b4b38122b32ee5e9b1ad924cb200", "ja": "だからさっきのロケで、スノードロップの白いお花を\n見つけたときは、ちょっとびっくりでした。", "zh": "所以我刚才出外景找到白色的雪铃花时，\n有一点点吃惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "435571b069878cd2ed4ce637e4ba55aaa9ac68f76e15252a4eeac4c1e481f604", "ja": "お仕事運はもちろん、金運、健康運、それに\nれん……。……れ、レンタル運もあがるって……！", "zh": "当然不只是工作运，听说财运、健康运，还有恋……\n……恋、练习运都会更好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c46b25dafd78fa96e2d5dc319f22d9affc025a7f56def8dd7fb9f896dbb8cdc8", "ja": "へえ、今はそんな運まで占いでわかるのか。\n最高じゃないか。今日は一日いいことづくめだな。", "zh": "是喔，现在连那种运势都占卜得出来啊？\n这样不是超棒吗？那你今天一整天都会遇见好事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "965f947aa65b4586e2565141f80dff08edbb04222adffd68f1f53c4bbd845882", "ja": "ただ……、その、勇気を出さないと、\nせっかくの運も、なくなってしまうみたいで……。", "zh": "只是……那个，要是不鼓起勇气，\n难得的好运似乎也会消失……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bcea9a7c0d4474cb58653df1a82732d5f90d9dcbae8e862449469495302416df", "ja": "……だから……。", "zh": "……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "28de8f4a7f77afaa4e8f84327e38c7802c379dd223ffe9a167a6bf7e1595af3d", "ja": "{$P$}！\nこのあと、少しだけ時間ありますか！？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n你接下来有一些些空闲时间吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "506a294424f1548b58054a123b63b568179b08ed98a855a8aa28b800b5df4fa1", "ja": "さっきのロケで、素敵な喫茶店を見かけて、\nできたら一緒にお茶とか……、ダメ、ですか……？", "zh": "我刚才出外景时，看见一家很棒的咖啡厅，\n可以的话希望能跟你一起喝杯茶……不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b16026b4c3b184212e403db965d5a65de1139af748289ee6f01c28eb556d9941", "ja": "お茶か。雪歩が仕事をがんばったおかげで\nこの後の予定が空いたから、俺はいいけど。", "zh": "喝茶吗？因为雪步你刚才很努力工作，\n我接下来的时间空下来了，所以我可以去喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d71640c0e187220dc5a239320500cd5bd4164cdcdd65321a078432d8cdc0354a", "ja": "でもいいのか？　今日の雪歩は最高の運勢なんだし、\nもっと別のことをした方が……。", "zh": "但这样好吗？今天雪步的运势是最棒的，\n还是做点其他事比较好吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "618ee491e9d46a8addd724f1904917961af04d05bad29b5bc05c7020d90710a0", "ja": "いいんですぅ！　私は{$P$}と\nのんびりお茶ができたら、それで幸せですから。", "zh": "这样就好了！我只要能跟{$P$}\n悠闲地喝茶就很幸福了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1019_p", "source_sha256": "668e0d82b7cf000dce8ca4c41a23ac999378ca9857bb2c4f6a58e24bd3beba58", "ja": "そ、そうか。雪歩がそう言ってくれるなら、\nありがたく、つきあわせてもらおうかな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。既然雪步你都这么说了，\n那我很荣幸能够作陪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0093_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "01bb2fcb8d99a926048df74b2d1fc6c1bb58609cd02b95e36e538adec3255910", "ja": "はいっ！　……勇気を出してよかった。\n今日はほんとに、超ハッピーデーです。えへへっ♪", "zh": "好的！……幸好我有鼓起勇气。\n今天真的是超幸运日，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
